# Root memory

- `docs/CLAUDE.md` — Governs the fixture's maintained documentation.
- `dated-records` — Retains bounded historical records for provenance.
- `reasoned-notes` — Retains explicitly exempt operational notes.
- `vendor/package` — Declares the optional shared-package boundary.

**Operational contract.** Maintained documents stay connected to this root.

| Section | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Release gate | Validate the complete declared corpus. |
